msgstr "输出为三波段 GeoTIFF：`dx`、`dy`（地面距离，单位为米）和 `snr`。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/cli.md:165
msgid "Multi-sensor pipelines"
msgstr "多传感器流水线"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/cli.md:177
